-- title:
--   Hasse parameter on a Drinfeld chart: purity of order q(q-1)
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime and $R$ a local commutative ring. Let $F$ be a one-dimensional formal group law over $R$ and let $x_0,x_1\in R$ satisfy `F.IsDrinfeldBasisAdic (maximalIdeal R) q x₀ x₁`, i.e. with the maximal ideal of $R$ taken as the ideal of definition, there is a unit power series $u\in R[[Z]]$ with $F$.`nthSeries` $q = u\cdot F$.`drinfeldDivisor` $q\,x_0\,x_1$, where `nthSeries` is defined by `nthSeries 0 = 0` and `nthSeries (n+1)` = substitution of (`nthSeries n`, `X`) into the two-variable group law, so that `nthSeries q` is the multiplication-by-$q$ series $[q]_F$. Let $T\in R$ be such that for some unit $w\in R$ the coefficient of $Z^q$ in $F$.`nthSeries` $q$ is congruent to $wT$ modulo the ideal generated by $q$. Let $W$ be a discrete valuation domain, complete for its maximal ideal, with $\mathfrak m_W=(\pi)$ and $\pi^{q-1}=\varepsilon q$ for a unit $\varepsilon$. Let $f,u,v\in W[[X_0,X_1]]$ with $u,v$ units and $f-(X_0X_1^q-X_0^qX_1)\in (X_0,X_1)^{q+2}$, and let $e\colon R\xrightarrow{\sim} W[[X_0,X_1]]/(\pi v-fu)$ be a ring isomorphism with $e(x_0)=\overline{X_0}$, $e(x_1)=\overline{X_1}$. Then there exists $h\in (X_0,X_1)^{q(q-1)}$ with $e(T)=\bar h$ such that for all $a,b\in W$ not both in $\mathfrak m_W$ with $a^qb-ab^q\in\mathfrak m_W$, the value $\sum_{i=0}^{q(q-1)}\mathrm{coeff}_{(i,\,q(q-1)-i)}(h)\,a^i b^{q(q-1)-i}$ of the degree-$q(q-1)$ part of $h$ is a unit in $W$.
--
--   This is the formal-group form of the statement that on a Drinfeld chart the Hasse parameter vanishes exactly to order $q(q-1)$, with initial form a unit multiple of the Dickson invariant, which is a unit at each $\mathbb F_q$-rational direction (Katz–Mazur, Theorem 13.8 and 13.7.6). It feeds the descriptions of adic completions of stalks on modular curves with full level structure at supersingular points, in [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevelOne.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_drinfeldChart_const_residueField_pow_hasse_of_mem_ssJSet_of_isPrimitiveRoot_mul_of_dvd`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevelOne.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_drinfeldChart_const_residueField_pow_hasse_of_mem_ssJSet_of_isPrimitiveRoot_mul_of_dvd) and [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevel.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_drinfeldChart_const_residueField_pow_hasse_of_mem_ssJSet`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.AuxLevel.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_drinfeldChart_const_residueField_pow_hasse_of_mem_ssJSet).
